---
import { urls } from "../config/urls";
---

<section id="plano" class="py-20 sm:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p
        class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-700 dark:text-brand-400"
      >
        Plano
      </p>

      <h2
        class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl"
      >
        Simples também na hora de assinar.
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        Um plano direto ao ponto, com acesso aos recursos.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-xl">
      <article
        class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-brand-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-35px_rgb(37_99_235/0.45)] dark:border-brand-900/70 dark:bg-slate-900 sm:p-8"
      >
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-56 w-56 rounded-full bg-brand-500/10 blur-3xl"
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div>
            <div>
              <p
                class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-700 dark:text-brand-400"
              >
                Essencial
              </p>

              <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                Tudo o que você precisa para começar.
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 flex items-end gap-2">
            <span
              class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white sm:text-5xl"
            >
              R$ 199
            </span>

            <span class="pb-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              /mês
            </span>
          </div>

          <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3.5">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
              <span
                class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-success-50 text-success-700 dark:bg-success-950/60 dark:text-success-300"
              >
                <svg
                  width="13"
                  height="13"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2.5"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>

              Produtos, categorias e controle de estoque
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
              <span
                class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-success-50 text-success-700 dark:bg-success-950/60 dark:text-success-300"
              >
                <svg
                  width="13"
                  height="13"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2.5"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>

              Registro e acompanhamento de vendas
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
              <span
                class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-success-50 text-success-700 dark:bg-success-950/60 dark:text-success-300"
              >
                <svg
                  width="13"
                  height="13"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2.5"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>

              Dashboard com indicadores da operação
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
              <span
                class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-success-50 text-success-700 dark:bg-success-950/60 dark:text-success-300"
              >
                <svg
                  width="13"
                  height="13"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2.5"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>

              Alertas de produtos com baixo estoque ou esgotado
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
              <span
                class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-success-50 text-success-700 dark:bg-success-950/60 dark:text-success-300"
              >
                <svg
                  width="13"
                  height="13"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2.5"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>

              Funcionários com cargos e acessos diferentes
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
              <span
                class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-success-50 text-success-700 dark:bg-success-950/60 dark:text-success-300"
              >
                <svg
                  width="13"
                  height="13"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2.5"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>

              Acesso pelo computador e celular
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
              <span
                class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-success-50 text-success-700 dark:bg-success-950/60 dark:text-success-300"
              >
                <svg
                  width="13"
                  height="13"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2.5"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>

              Suporte incluído
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
              <span
                class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-success-50 text-success-700 dark:bg-success-950/60 dark:text-success-300"
              >
                <svg
                  width="13"
                  height="13"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2.5"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>

              Atualizações e melhorias incluídas
            </li>
          </ul>

          <a
            href={urls.signup}
            class="mt-8 inline-flex h-12 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-brand-600 px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-brand-700 hover:shadow-md"
          >
            Testar grátis por 7 dias

            <svg
              width="17"
              height="17"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
              <path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <p class="mt-4 text-center text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
            Teste por 7 dias sem cadastrar cartão de crédito. A assinatura pode
            ser cancelada a qualquer momento.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
